  The reel_script says the victim is a 'பாதிக்கப்பட்ட 24 வயது பெண்' — the article gives her age, but describing her as an identifiable victim with age plus parent and neighbourhood could be considered identifying detail for a sexual offence victim; she is not named, so this is borderline, but the reel_script's 'பெண்ணின் தாய் பணிக்குச் சென்றிருந்தபோது' and similar details combine with location and age to identify her; the article does not give the victim's age as a line of fact tied to identity beyond what is stated, so this is flagged as an identifying-detail concern.
